<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        At <%= siteTitle %>, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We do not require user accounts. The only data we receive is the video URL you submit for downloading. We do not store this data permanently.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Log Data</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Our server may log basic request metadata (IP address, timestamp, requested path) for operational and security purposes. Logs are rotated and not used for profiling or advertising.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We do not use tracking cookies. Local storage may be used to remember your theme preference.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">If enabled, we may display ads through Google AdSense. Please review <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Google’s Privacy Policy</a> for details on how Google processes ad data.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Downloaded files are temporarily stored on the server and are not retained after you retrieve them.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">For privacy questions, please use the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
